${bloomsText}

For Level 6, PREFER verbs from levels 3-6 (Applying, Analysing, Evaluating, Creating).

=== ACTIVE LEARNING STRATEGIES ===
${strategiesText}

Always name the specific strategy used. Each step must use a named strategy.

=== LEARNING PLAN CONTEXT (this SP must align with this LP) ===
${lpContext}

=== TEACHER INPUT ===
Unit Title: ${unitTitle}
Unit Code: ${unitCode}
Class: ${className}
Learners: ${numLearners}
Week: ${weekNo}
Session Title: ${sessionTitle}
