LLN Requirements: ${llnReq}
Special Instructions: ${specialInstr}

=== SESSION STRUCTURE ===
Generate a 3-hour session (180 minutes total) with this structure:
- Introduction: 10 mins
- Step 1: 40 mins
- Step 2a: 40 mins
- Step 2b: 40 mins
- Step 3: 40 mins
- Session Review: 10 mins

=== OUTPUT FORMAT ===
Return ONLY this JSON. All values must be strings.

{
  "learning_outcomes": "3-4 outcomes starting with Bloom's verbs, each on new line starting with dash",
  "references": "2-3 APA formatted references relevant to this topic",
  "learning_aids": "3-5 physical or digital learning aids",
  "safety_requirements": "relevant safety requirements for this session",
  "intro_activity": "What trainer does in introduction — board work, attendance, recap, bridge-in",
  "step1_trainer": "Trainer activity for Step 1 with named strategy",
  "step1_trainee": "Trainee activity for Step 1 with named strategy",
  "step1_time": "40 mins",
  "step2a_trainer": "Trainer activity for Step 2a with named strategy",
  "step2a_trainee": "Trainee activity for Step 2a with named strategy",
  "step2a_time": "40 mins",
  "step2b_trainer": "Trainer activity for Step 2b with named strategy",
  "step2b_trainee": "Trainee activity for Step 2b with named strategy",
