${bloomsText}

=== SESSION CONTEXT ===
Unit Title: ${unitTitle}
Unit Code: ${unitCode}
Class: ${className}
Level: 6
Session Title: ${sessionTitle}
Session Topic Hints: ${sessionHints}
Special Instructions: ${specialInstr}
