=== TEACHER'S NOTES REQUIREMENTS ===
The trainer teaches Level 6 practical units (Networking, Mathematics).
Sessions are 3 hours long.
Content notes must be detailed enough to guide the trainer through the 
full session without referring to other materials.
Worked examples must include all three types:
1. Configuration walkthrough (step by step)
